Please think about it.

2102
02:01:56.083 --> 02:02:00.042
<i>Then broke into a smile</i>

2103
02:02:00.292 --> 02:02:04.250
<i>My heart</i>

2104
02:02:04.333 --> 02:02:08.208
<i>Oh, this heart of mine</i>

2105
