Nights that turn to dawn</i>

2255
02:11:52.500 --> 02:11:55.250
<i>We spent every stage of life intertwined</i>

2256
02:11:55.667 --> 02:11:58.250
<i>Each moment is etched within my heart</i>

2257
02:11:58.458 --> 02:12:01.458
<i>Whether you remember</i>

2258
02:12:01.750 --> 02:12:04.458
<i>No grudges or complaints</i>

2259
02:12:04.958 --> 02:12:07.625
<i>We met like sun meets morning rain</i>

2260
02:12:08.000 --> 02:12:10.667
<i>I have not forgotten a single feeling</i>

2261
02:12:10.792 --> 02:12:13.458
<i>Whether you remember</i>

2262
02:12:13.833 --> 02:12:19.542
<i>Whether you remember or not</i>

2263
02:12:19.792 --> 02:12:26.417
<i>Whether you remember or not</i>

2264
02:12:44.625 --> 02:12:47.667
How can you just let anyone
into my room? It's not safe.

2265
02:12:47.792 --> 02:12:50.292
You have no idea
who's coming in and out of here!

2266
02:12:50.375 --> 02:12:52.184
- Look, he's still standing there!
- Sorry, ma'am.

2267
02:12:52.208 --> 02:12:54.351
- Don't you care about women's safety here?
- Go, catch him!

2268
02:12:54.375 --> 02:12:56.393
I'm calling the police.
I'll have this whole place shut down!

2269
02:12:56.417 --> 02:12:57.292
Sorry, ma'am.

2270
02:12:57.375 --> 02:12:59.792
- Go after him!
<i>- I have not forgotten a single feeling</i>

2271
02:13:00.042 --> 02:13:03.375
<i>Whether you remember</i>

2272
02:13:03.458 --> 02:13:06.167
<i>No grudges or complaints</i>

2273
02:13:06.458 --> 02:13:09.083
<i>We met like sun meets morning rain</i>

2274
02:13:09.583 --> 02:13:12.167
<i>I have not forgotten a single feeling</i>

2275
02:13:12.333 --> 02:13:15.167
<i>Whether you remember</i>

2276
02:13:15.375 --> 02:13:20.583
<i>Whether you remember or not</i>

2277
02:13:20.667 --> 02:13:22.958
When's Arijit coming back from the US?

2278
02:13:23.083 --> 02:13:24.708
When's he going to respond?

2279
02:13:24.792 --> 02:13:26.208
When will we record it?

2280
02:13:26.292 --> 02:13:27.375
- When will we shoot?
- I…

2281
02:13:27.458 --> 02:13:28.958
I told you to keep a backup ready.

2282
02:13:29.042 --> 02:13:30.917
We can't do much, sir.
Everyone wants Arijit.

2283
02:13:31.000 --> 02:13:32.542
I need a song, sir.

2284
02:13:32.625 --> 02:13:34.000
I need to shoot.

2285
02:13:34.083 --> 02:13:36.042
I want the song tomorrow,
no matter what.

2286
02:13:36.167 --> 02:13:37.447
- Alright.
- If he's not available,

2287
02:13:37.500 --> 02:13:39.625
find someone else and call them.

2288
02:13:39.833 --> 02:13:41.042
I want my song.

2289
02:13:41.167 --> 02:13:42.500
- Hello, sir.
- Oh, hi.

2290
02:13:43.167 --> 02:13:44.167
How's it going?

2291
02:13:44.500 --> 02:13:45.667
Still sticking with it.

2292
02:13:46.667 --> 02:13:47.833
Why don't you make him sing?

2293
02:13:48.917 --> 02:13:50.875
- Try him.
- Sir, he's just an arranger.

2294
02:13:51.000 --> 02:13:53.167
No, I know
he's got a playback singer's voice.

2295
02:13:53.333 --> 02:13:55.333
I've heard his stuff.
He messaged me on WhatsApp.

2296
02:13:55.917 --> 02:13:56.833
Are you sure?

2297
02:13:56.917 --> 02:13:57.958
I'm very sure.

2298
02:13:58.083 --> 02:13:59.208
Please, try him out.

2299
02:13:59.292 --> 02:14:00.167
Yes, sir.

2300
02:14:00.250 --> 02:14:01.125
Let's do this.
Somu…

2301
02:14:01.208 --> 02:14:02.208
All the best.

2302
02:14:24.208 --> 02:14:25.500
Shruti Shukla!

2303
02:14:37.167 --> 02:14:38.167
Hello, Baba?

2304
02:14:38.833 --> 02:14:39.833
Ma…

2305
02:14:43.792 --> 02:14:44.833
Your Ma…

2306
02:14:45.917 --> 02:14:47.375
Baba, are you crying?

2307
02:14:48.833 --> 02:14:49.833
Got married…

2308
02:14:50.625 --> 02:14:52.292
Who got married?
Baba, hello?

2309
02:14:53.917 --> 02:14:56.000
- Again…
<i>- Baba, I'm calling Ma.</i>

2310
02:14:56.083 --> 02:14:57.604
<i>Just relax. I'll be there by tomorrow.</i>

2311
02:14:59.542 --> 02:15:00.542
Hello?

2312
02:15:07.542 --> 02:15:09.958
- Hi, Ma!
- Hold, hold, hold, Chumki.

2313
02:15:11.625 --> 02:15:12.958
Ma, it's quite noisy there.

2314
02:15:14.042 --> 02:15:15.500
My college's reunion…

2315
02:15:15.833 --> 02:15:17.393
Hang on,
I'll introduce you to everyone.

2316
02:15:20.292 --> 02:15:22.042
I'll bring sis on the call too.

2317
02:15:22.125 --> 02:15:24.000
- Hello, everyone. Chumki.
- Hi.

2318
02:15:24.083 --> 02:15:25.208
Thank you.

2319
02:15:25.375 --> 02:15:26.458
No worries.

2320
02:15:28.667 --> 02:15:29.917
Oh, I have to take this.

2321
02:15:30.250 --> 02:15:31.875
<i>- Hello, dear.</i>
- Hello, auntie.

2322
02:15:32.833 --> 02:15:33.833
- Hello!
<i>- How are you?</i>

2323
02:15:35.458 --> 02:15:36.667
I quit my job.

2324
02:15:38.792 --> 02:15:39.833
I'm sorry.

2325
02:15:42.083 --> 02:15:42.958
I know

2326
02:15:43.042 --> 02:15:44.101
- I should've done it a long time ago.
<i>- Hi, Ma.</i>

2327
02:15:44.125 --> 02:15:45.125
<i>Hi, Chumki.</i>

2328
02:15:47.167 --> 02:15:48.208
Hi, sis.

2329
02:15:48.625 --> 02:15:49.625
Chumki…

2330
02:15:51.417 --> 02:15:52.417
How are you?

2331
02:15:52.542 --> 02:15:54.917
When are you both coming back?
I'll be back in a minute.

2332
02:15:55.125 --> 02:15:56.500
I'll be back tomorrow.

2333
02:15:56.583 --> 02:15:58.000
I'm coming back tomorrow too.

2334
02:15:58.167 --> 02:15:59.042
<i>Okay.</i>

2335
02:15:59.125 --> 02:16:01.292
Wow, Ma, it's so nice
to see you like this.

2336
02:16:01.417 --> 02:16:03.333
Right?
Even I'm surprised at myself.

2337
02:16:03.542 --> 02:16:05.902
<i>I didn't even realize how fast
these last four days flew by.</i>

2338
02:16:06.500 --> 02:16:08.208
<i>Madness, friends…</i>

2339
02:16:09.125 --> 02:16:13.375
And I keep thinking how amazing it would
be if life could just go on like this.

2340
02:16:15.708 --> 02:16:16.750
But you know,

2341
02:16:16.833 --> 02:16:19.083
we spend half our lives stuck
in confusion,

2342
02:16:19.167 --> 02:16:20.708
not really knowing what we want.

2343
02:16:21.583 --> 02:16:23.584
<i>We don't make the right decision
at the right time.</i>

2344
02:16:23.833 --> 02:16:25.458
And in hoping for something better,

2345
02:16:27.208 --> 02:16:28.792
we end up choosing what's safer.

2346
02:16:29.625 --> 02:16:33.583
<i>Then we spend the rest of our lives
swinging between "I wish" and "what if."</i>

2347
02:16:34.583 --> 02:16:36.708
Deep down, your heart always
knows what it wants.

2348
02:16:37.542 --> 02:16:38.583
It sends you signals, too.

2349
02:16:40.167 --> 02:16:41.458
We just forget to listen.

2350
02:16:43.417 --> 02:16:45.125
<i>I'll tell you
all the stories when we meet.</i>

2351
02:16:45.792 --> 02:16:47.958
But it was bizarre.

2352
02:16:48.542 --> 02:16:50.500
<i>So much drama, I tell you…</i>

2353
02:16:50.917 --> 02:16:52.667
But honestly,
that drama brought me

2354
02:16:53.625 --> 02:16:56.417
back to myself, the old Bani.

2355
02:16:57.125 --> 02:16:58.559
<i>She now understands
that instead of regretting</i>

2356
02:16:58.583 --> 02:17:00.083
<i>- the chances you never took…</i>
- Glasses.

2357
02:17:00.167 --> 02:17:02.917
<i>It's better to take the risk
and deal with the fallout later.</i>

2358
02:17:04.458 --> 02:17:06.500
I had the time of my life!

2359
02:17:06.583 --> 02:17:07.583
Really!

2360
02:17:08.958 --> 02:17:10.000
Shibani!

2361
02:17:10.417 --> 02:17:11.417
Coming!

2362
02:17:11.583 --> 02:17:14.125
I'll see you at dinner tomorrow
and tell you everything.

2363
02:17:14.208 --> 02:17:15.083
Okay, bye, Ma.

2364
02:17:15.167 --> 02:17:16.292
<i>- Bye.</i>
- Bye, Ma.

2365
02:17:22.458 --> 02:17:25.083
- You forgot your glasses.
- Oh shit!

2366
02:17:25.500 --> 02:17:27.750
- Thank you.
- It's okay. No worries.

2367
02:17:29.500 --> 02:17:30.500
Goodnight, Maya.

2368
02:17:31.625 --> 02:17:32.708
Actually…

2369
02:17:33.083 --> 02:17:35.417
Actually, my name isn't Maya.

2370
02:17:37.542 --> 02:17:38.833
My name's Kajol.

2371
02:17:39.917 --> 02:17:40.958
Okay.

2372
02:17:41.083 --> 02:17:42.125
Kajol Ghosh.

2373
02:17:42.750 --> 02:17:43.750
Sorry.

2374
02:17:50.333 --> 02:17:51.375
One sec, one sec.

2375
02:17:51.458 --> 02:17:53.542
This song might sound romantic,

2376
02:17:54.000 --> 02:17:56.201
but it's not your typical hero-heroine
kind of romantic.

2377
02:17:56.458 --> 02:17:58.583
Our protagonist had a baby.

2378
02:17:58.667 --> 02:18:00.042
He's singing it for his child.

2379
02:18:00.375 --> 02:18:03.042
So picture that it's your baby
and sing from that place.

2380
02:18:03.792 --> 02:18:05.375
I don't have a baby.

2381
02:18:05.792 --> 02:18:07.272
But you've got an imagination, right?

2382
02:18:14.500 --> 02:18:18.083
<i>Look</i>

2383
02:18:18.458 --> 02:18:23.208
<i>How your arrival changed my life</i>

2384
02:18:23.708 --> 02:18:27.000
<i>A closed room lit up</i>

2385
02:18:27.542 --> 02:18:32.000
<i>And a window opened wide</i>

2386
02:18:32.292 --> 02:18:35.625
<i>Look</i>

2387
02:18:35.792 --> 02:18:40.333
<i>How your arrival changed my life</i>

2388
02:18:40.792 --> 02:18:44.417
<i>A closed room lit up</i>

2389
02:18:44.625 --> 02:18:50.125
<i>And a window opened wide</i>

2390
02:18:52.667 --> 02:18:56.750
<i>Your tiny hands gripping my finger tight</i>

2391
02:18:56.833 --> 02:19:01.458
<i>Since I saw you, the world feels right</i>

2392
02:19:01.583 --> 02:19:05.917
<i>You waking softly in the night</i>

2393
02:19:06.000 --> 02:19:11.625
<i>You speaking to me without a word in sight</i>

2394
02:19:14.167 --> 02:19:18.333
<i>You sleeping as the morning breaks</i>

2395
02:19:18.500 --> 02:19:22.417
<i>Your breath is all my being needs</i>

2396
02:19:22.500 --> 02:19:27.000
<i>My shoulder is now your resting place</i>

2397
02:19:27.500 --> 02:19:33.958
<i>Your babbling sounds like music to me</i>

2398
02:19:35.000 --> 02:19:36.000
<i>Papa.</i>

2399
02:19:48.917 --> 02:19:49.917
Cut.

2400
02:19:52.208 --> 02:19:53.500
I am sorry.
Cut.

2401
02:19:54.958 --> 02:19:55.958
Is he alright?

2402
02:20:04.042 --> 02:20:06.625
There's a lot we never said
to each other, right?

2403
02:20:07.167 --> 02:20:09.667
I felt there was
something real between us.

2404
02:20:10.208 --> 02:20:11.208
We connected. Right?

2405
02:20:11.375 --> 02:20:13.042
Everything remained incomplete...

2406
02:20:33.708 --> 02:20:35.417
- Chumki…
- My bag, please.

2407
02:20:37.542 --> 02:20:40.083
- Chumki…
- I'm leaving. Lock the door when you go.

2408
02:20:44.833 --> 02:20:47.625
- I'm going to kill you!
- Sanjeev!

2409
02:20:56.375 --> 02:20:57.375
Rickshaw!

2410
02:20:59.958 --> 02:21:00.958
Rickshaw!

2411
02:21:01.083 --> 02:21:03.375
Let him go! Let him go!

2412
02:21:03.458 --> 02:21:04.750
What are you doing?

2413
02:21:14.500 --> 02:21:17.542
What friend? What did you do?

2414
02:21:17.625 --> 02:21:19.750
Your husband just hit me!

2415
02:21:19.833 --> 02:21:21.583
- Please!
- Sanjeev!

2416
02:21:23.333 --> 02:21:24.750
Rickshaw!

2417
02:21:26.458 --> 02:21:27.875
Stop. Stop.

2418
02:21:32.000 --> 02:21:33.000
Airport.

2419
02:21:38.542 --> 02:21:39.958
I can't!

2420
02:21:40.417 --> 02:21:41.500
Sorry.

2421
02:21:41.708 --> 02:21:42.750
What's going on?

2422
02:21:42.833 --> 02:21:44.167
Why do I still love him so much?

2423
02:21:46.417 --> 02:21:47.457
Who are you talking about?

2424
02:22:55.250 --> 02:22:56.250
Careful.

2425
02:22:57.792 --> 02:22:58.792
Ambala.

2426
02:22:59.500 --> 02:23:00.500
Shimla.

2427
02:23:09.417 --> 02:23:10.417
Kajol!

2428
02:23:12.375 --> 02:23:14.917
Hello! Wait! Stop!

2429
02:23:25.292 --> 02:23:26.292
Hello!

2430
02:23:27.417 --> 02:23:28.583
Say something!

2431
02:23:32.625 --> 02:23:35.708
I don't know if I like boys or girls.

2432
02:23:37.833 --> 02:23:38.917
When will you know?

2433
02:23:39.917 --> 02:23:40.917
I don't know.

2434
02:23:42.042 --> 02:23:44.208
Okay. I'll wait till you figure it out.

2435
02:24:18.208 --> 02:24:19.208
Chumki!

2436
02:24:19.500 --> 02:24:20.500
Chumki!

2437
02:24:22.583 --> 02:24:23.583
Hi.

2438
02:24:23.917 --> 02:24:25.125
I knew you'd show up.

2439
02:24:25.833 --> 02:24:27.542
Did you come straight from bed?

2440
02:24:27.625 --> 02:24:28.625
Where's your luggage?

2441
02:24:29.375 --> 02:24:31.250
Get off at the next station
and come here.

2442
02:24:31.333 --> 02:24:33.375
Parth, I need to talk to you.

2443
02:24:33.958 --> 02:24:34.958
Yeah, what's up?

2444
02:24:35.125 --> 02:24:36.375
I really like…

2445
02:24:37.292 --> 02:24:38.208
Your company.

2446
02:24:38.292 --> 02:24:39.833
I really like your company.

2447
02:24:40.542 --> 02:24:42.167
Me too. Ditto.

2448
02:24:42.917 --> 02:24:45.000
I know we haven't spent
much time together,

2449
02:24:45.083 --> 02:24:48.667
but it feels very real.

2450
02:24:49.333 --> 02:24:51.042
It feels different with you. I…

2451
02:24:52.042 --> 02:24:54.042
I like myself more when I'm with you.

2452
02:24:55.042 --> 02:24:56.958
I… Okay.

2453
02:24:57.500 --> 02:24:58.518
And honestly, I'm very jealous

2454
02:24:58.542 --> 02:24:59.417
because you're getting
married to someone else.

2455
02:24:59.500 --> 02:25:00.500
What?

2456
02:25:02.417 --> 02:25:07.000
I'm very jealous because you're
getting married to someone else.

2457
02:25:09.083 --> 02:25:10.843
You haven't come here to
"I love you", right?

2458
02:25:23.167 --> 02:25:24.167
<i>Hi.</i>

2459
02:25:24.250 --> 02:25:25.292
You didn't sleep?

2460
02:25:25.375 --> 02:25:26.958
<i>Yeah, no.</i>

2461
02:25:28.000 --> 02:25:29.250
<i>You're done with the recording?</i>

2462
02:25:30.292 --> 02:25:31.292
<i>How did it go?</i>

2463
02:25:32.000 --> 02:25:33.208
It was fine.

2464
02:25:35.042 --> 02:25:40.125
<i>Hey, I can't connect to the Wi-Fi
on my laptop.</i>

2465
02:25:42.083 --> 02:25:44.417
Restart both the laptop and the router.

2466
02:25:46.458 --> 02:25:47.458
I'll hold.

2467
02:25:47.917 --> 02:25:48.917
<i>Give me a minute.</i>

2468
02:25:49.625 --> 02:25:50.625
<i>It's turning on.</i>

2469
02:25:53.542 --> 02:25:54.792
<i>Alright, done.</i>

2470
02:25:56.625 --> 02:26:01.792
Now go to settings and hit
"Forget Network."

2471
02:26:02.833 --> 02:26:04.125
Then try connecting again.

2472
02:26:05.042 --> 02:26:06.083
Forget network…

2473
02:26:07.292 --> 02:26:08.292
Connect…

2474
02:26:09.750 --> 02:26:10.750
It's working.

2475
02:26:14.125 --> 02:26:15.125
Even without the laptop?

2476
02:26:32.250 --> 02:26:33.250
Parth!

2477
02:26:36.042 --> 02:26:37.083
Parth!

2478
02:26:38.500 --> 02:26:41.125
I love…

2479
02:26:41.250 --> 02:26:42.333
I love you!

2480
02:26:47.833 --> 02:26:50.393
What! What's the guarantee you won't fall
for a third girl tomorrow?

2481
02:26:50.417 --> 02:26:51.625
No, I guarantee that.

2482
02:26:52.667 --> 02:26:53.667
She's it, full and final.

2483
02:26:53.708 --> 02:26:54.875
This isn't a joke, son.

2484
02:26:55.375 --> 02:26:56.934
You're breaking off one engagement
to marry her.

2485
02:26:56.958 --> 02:26:59.059
- What if tomorrow you want to marry...
- I'm not marrying him.

2486
02:26:59.083 --> 02:26:59.958
What?

2487
02:27:00.042 --> 02:27:01.333
- You're not marrying him?
- What?

2488
02:27:01.583 --> 02:27:02.583
Then?

2489
02:27:03.250 --> 02:27:04.792
I'm not marrying you.

2490
02:27:05.667 --> 02:27:07.292
You don't want to marry me,

2491
02:27:07.458 --> 02:27:09.379
but you also don't want me
to marry someone else?

2492
02:27:10.250 --> 02:27:11.250
Yes.

2493
02:27:11.792 --> 02:27:12.667
- Yes?
- Yes.

2494
02:27:12.750 --> 02:27:13.950
What does that even mean?
What?

2495
02:27:16.667 --> 02:27:18.583
It means I love you.

2496
02:27:18.792 --> 02:27:20.375
Maybe I'm not ready right now.

2497
02:27:22.042 --> 02:27:25.000
But someday in the future… maybe?

2498
02:27:25.458 --> 02:27:26.458
Maybe?

2499
02:27:26.833 --> 02:27:29.375
My grandfather came all the way
from Madagascar.

2500
02:27:30.083 --> 02:27:32.333
He's 82. He might not be here
"someday".

2501
02:27:32.417 --> 02:27:34.217
Auntie Neetu changed
three flights to be here.

2502
02:27:35.792 --> 02:27:37.750
And I've already booked
the honeymoon in Bali.

2503
02:27:38.500 --> 02:27:42.000
It's a nonrefundable thing, man.

2504
02:27:44.708 --> 02:27:45.708
Sorry.

2505
02:27:46.750 --> 02:27:49.375
Forget I was here. I'm so sorry.

2506
02:27:49.458 --> 02:27:51.083
Okay? Cancel.

2507
02:27:51.167 --> 02:27:52.083
I'm sorry.

2508
02:27:52.167 --> 02:27:53.208
Forget it.

2509
02:27:53.333 --> 02:27:54.667
Control. Alt. Delete. Sorry.

2510
02:27:54.750 --> 02:27:55.833
Dear…

2511
02:27:56.083 --> 02:27:58.292
- I'm fine.
- Dear!

2512
02:28:18.583 --> 02:28:20.417
You shouldn't have had the abortion.

2513
02:28:21.083 --> 02:28:22.208
No…

2514
02:28:22.667 --> 02:28:24.667
I'm sorry.

2515
02:28:31.708 --> 02:28:32.708
I'm sorry.

2516
02:28:33.292 --> 02:28:36.708
I'm selfish. I'm very selfish.

2517
02:28:37.125 --> 02:28:39.000
Forgive me.

2518
02:28:43.750 --> 02:28:46.333
I am sorry.

2519
02:28:46.458 --> 02:28:47.500
Akash.

2520
02:28:55.625 --> 02:28:56.542
I…

2521
02:28:56.625 --> 02:28:58.958
I am always late.

2522
02:29:00.333 --> 02:29:01.542
I just want you.

2523
02:29:02.583 --> 02:29:04.083
I don't want anything else.

2524
02:29:05.958 --> 02:29:07.583
I just want you.

2525
02:29:11.000 --> 02:29:13.583
It's too freaking late!

2526
02:29:15.500 --> 02:29:16.941
You shouldn't have had the abortion.

2527
02:29:17.667 --> 02:29:19.987
- I freaking know it's too late now!
- No, it's not too late.

2528
02:29:21.625 --> 02:29:22.625
No.

2529
02:29:58.667 --> 02:29:59.708
So, now?

2530
02:30:02.417 --> 02:30:03.417
Now?

2531
02:30:07.083 --> 02:30:08.292
Let's just get fake married.

2532
02:30:09.375 --> 02:30:11.333
Otherwise, they'll disown me.

2533
02:30:12.375 --> 02:30:13.655
Then promise me something first.

2534
02:30:13.833 --> 02:30:14.833
What?

2535
02:30:15.167 --> 02:30:16.958
From this moment on,

2536
02:30:17.250 --> 02:30:18.625
no one else gets to see you naked.

2537
02:30:19.917 --> 02:30:21.042
Done.

2538
02:30:21.750 --> 02:30:23.950
But for that to work,
you'll have to see me naked first.

2539
02:30:27.167 --> 02:30:30.500
- Your mom?
- Yes, Mom.

2540
02:30:32.792 --> 02:30:34.667
- Hi.
- Hey.

2541
02:30:35.625 --> 02:30:37.542
<i>-The one you lost</i>
-What's up?

2542
02:30:37.875 --> 02:30:39.250
<i>Yesterday</i>

2543
02:30:40.083 --> 02:30:41.500
How are you, buddy?

2544
02:30:42.250 --> 02:30:43.250
Still angry with me?

2545
02:30:43.333 --> 02:30:44.375
Hi.

2546
02:30:44.792 --> 02:30:46.708
<i>The one who was upset smiled</i>

2547
02:30:46.958 --> 02:30:48.042
Hi.

2548
02:30:48.125 --> 02:30:49.542
- Hi, baby.
- Hi, Mumma.

2549
02:30:49.833 --> 02:30:50.958
Papa's not here?

2550
02:30:51.083 --> 02:30:53.000
No, he's not. He'll join us later.

2551
02:30:53.083 --> 02:30:54.083
Come, sit.

2552
02:30:54.125 --> 02:30:57.042
<i>How can we ever part?</i>

2553
02:30:57.750 --> 02:31:01.708
<i>We are, after all, one</i>

2554
02:31:02.625 --> 02:31:06.958
<i>Love is like salt and sugar
Both add flavor, but in their own way</i>

2555
02:31:07.083 --> 02:31:13.667
<i>This distance has been erased on its own</i>

2556
02:31:14.750 --> 02:31:19.167
<i>It's a wonderful journey</i>

2557
02:31:20.042 --> 02:31:24.667
<i>The wheel of life keeps moving</i>

2558
02:31:24.792 --> 02:31:31.667
<i>Instead of halting
It's better to keep moving</i>

2559
02:31:32.417 --> 02:31:36.833
<i>It's a wonderful journey</i>

2560
02:31:36.958 --> 02:31:40.125
We're out of chicken, please refill this.

2561
02:31:41.958 --> 02:31:43.198
Is it going to go on like this?

2562
02:31:44.000 --> 02:31:45.083
No response?

2563
02:31:45.167 --> 02:31:46.500
What do you want? A divorce?

2564
02:31:48.875 --> 02:31:50.875
How else can I tell you that I am sorry?

2565
02:31:51.542 --> 02:31:53.102
How many more times should I say sorry?

2566
02:31:54.292 --> 02:31:57.333
Can't we start again from the beginning?

2567
02:31:58.875 --> 02:32:02.458
You don't want to know
what happened in that room in Goa?

2568
02:32:03.958 --> 02:32:08.417
No, I don't.
I don't want to know anything.

2569
02:32:08.958 --> 02:32:11.167
All I know is that I was about
to lose you.

2570
02:32:11.833 --> 02:32:16.000
Forget Goa, I don't care about anything
that happened before this very second.

2571
02:32:16.583 --> 02:32:19.292
Stay angry, stay as mad as you want,

2572
02:32:19.958 --> 02:32:21.759
but please let me keep trying
to win you over.

2573
02:32:22.500 --> 02:32:24.958
All this…

2574
02:32:26.083 --> 02:32:29.583
Yoga, meditation, mindfulness,
none of it works

2575
02:32:30.500 --> 02:32:33.125
Look, like a joker

2576
02:32:33.542 --> 02:32:35.333
I followed you around for so many days.

2577
02:32:35.833 --> 02:32:37.542
And I want to keep following you around.

2578
02:32:38.417 --> 02:32:39.417
For the rest of my life.

2579
02:32:43.750 --> 02:32:45.583
I want to charm you again.

2580
02:32:47.250 --> 02:32:49.250
Again, and again.

2581
02:32:49.917 --> 02:32:50.917
Forever.

2582
02:32:52.083 --> 02:32:53.875
Only with you, every time.

2583
02:32:58.917 --> 02:33:01.750
Your love for doing it in the open air
will get us caught one day.

2584
02:33:47.333 --> 02:33:48.458
Bye…

2585
02:33:49.042 --> 02:33:50.250
See you.

2586
02:33:50.500 --> 02:33:51.583
Bye.

2587
02:33:56.583 --> 02:33:57.667
Which way do I turn?

2588
02:33:58.000 --> 02:34:00.250
Yeah, I'm just checking...

2589
02:34:00.333 --> 02:34:02.583
- Shit, it was that right we just passed.
- Which one?

2590
02:34:02.792 --> 02:34:04.167
Oh no, one minute

2591
02:34:04.250 --> 02:34:07.333
If you hold your phone like that,
then this is bound to happen…

2592
02:34:07.417 --> 02:34:10.375
How is it my fault if the map
keeps changing the route?

2593
02:34:10.667 --> 02:34:13.417
Now I have to take the long U-turn.

2594
02:34:13.750 --> 02:34:16.500
- No…
- Besides, this still hasn't been fixed.

2595
02:34:22.542 --> 02:34:24.083
We were supposed to fix this.

2596
02:34:24.750 --> 02:34:25.750
We'll fix it.

2597
02:34:26.042 --> 02:34:30.125
<i>After losing you
And then finding you again</i>

2598
02:34:31.083 --> 02:34:35.333
<i>I've developed a habit of it</i>

2599
02:34:35.875 --> 02:34:40.125
<i>Feels like now</i>

2600
02:34:40.917 --> 02:34:45.250
<i>True love is mine to claim…</i>

2601
02:34:45.417 --> 02:34:46.833
How did this happen?

2602
02:34:47.167 --> 02:34:49.333
How will I know? You tell me.

2603
02:34:49.417 --> 02:34:51.458
But these aren't
"two full dark pink lines," right?

2604
02:34:51.583 --> 02:34:52.875
Yes, they are!

2605
02:34:52.958 --> 02:34:55.458
<i>The voice I heard</i>

2606
02:34:55.792 --> 02:35:00.667
<i>Feels like now</i>

2607
02:35:00.917 --> 02:35:05.458
<i>True love is mine to claim</i>

2608
02:35:06.208 --> 02:35:08.101
Shruti, listen carefully.
I'm playing two temp tracks.

2609
02:35:08.125 --> 02:35:10.208
First, stop this guy's singing!

2610
02:35:10.292 --> 02:35:11.852
The producer is coming in half an hour.

2611
02:35:11.958 --> 02:35:13.758
I have to present them soon,
so please listen.

2612
02:35:14.458 --> 02:35:17.208
I can't hear anything right now!
Can't you see he's crying?

2613
02:35:17.667 --> 02:35:19.250
Please, sweetheart.

2614
02:35:19.583 --> 02:35:21.375
Stop! I have a child with me!

2615
02:35:21.917 --> 02:35:24.542
Look, I can't talk right now.
I have too much to do.

2616
02:35:24.625 --> 02:35:25.625
<i>- I have to go.</i>
- You know…

2617
02:35:25.708 --> 02:35:28.143
- Everything is falling apart. Bye!
- I don't present without you, Shruti.

2618
02:35:28.167 --> 02:35:29.167
Listen.

2619
02:35:29.333 --> 02:35:32.167
My hands were shaking,
my heart was racing.

2620
02:35:32.292 --> 02:35:33.708
I was really nervous.

2621
02:35:33.833 --> 02:35:35.417
I aimed for the heart,

2622
02:35:35.500 --> 02:35:37.333
but I guess I shot too low!

2623
02:35:39.500 --> 02:35:40.708
Too good!

2624
02:35:41.125 --> 02:35:44.542
<i>You're all mine</i>

2625
02:35:47.542 --> 02:35:50.667
<i>You are my responsibility</i>

2626
02:35:51.042 --> 02:35:53.500
<i>There are plenty of grievances, too</i>

2627
02:35:53.625 --> 02:35:58.458
<i>In my obstinacy to defeat you
My life was lost to you</i>

2628
02:35:58.667 --> 02:36:01.000
<i>If I ever made you cry</i>

2629
02:36:01.125 --> 02:36:03.417
<i>I was also bereft of solace</i>

2630
02:36:03.583 --> 02:36:06.000
<i>My heart is yours, after all</i>

2631
02:36:06.083 --> 02:36:07.667
<i>It's all yours</i>

2632
02:36:07.750 --> 02:36:09.292
<i>What do I tell you?</i>

2633
02:36:09.833 --> 02:36:12.417
<i>The amount of solace I gained</i>

2634
02:36:12.667 --> 02:36:17.417
<i>After getting this pain</i>

2635
02:36:17.625 --> 02:36:22.292
<i>Feels like now</i>

2636
02:36:22.708 --> 02:36:27.792
<i>True love is mine to claim</i>
